WEBVTT

00:40:56.454 --> 00:41:03.788
developed in secret and to be left
developed purely by corporations who have

00:41:03.788 --> 00:41:05.204
whatever incentive they may have.

00:41:05.454 --> 00:41:11.996
We need a nonprofit that will develop
and share knowledge openly.

00:41:12.329 --> 00:41:14.579
First of all, just even
at that early stage,

00:41:14.788 --> 00:41:16.246
some people were confused about this.

00:41:16.246 --> 00:41:18.746
It was saying if this thing
is so dangerous,

00:41:19.413 --> 00:41:22.121
why on earth would you want to

00:41:24.246 --> 00:41:26.579
make it secrets even more available?

00:41:26.829 --> 00:41:32.246
Well, maybe giving the tools to that sort
of AI terrorist in his bedroom somewhere,